This is a finite-budget loss, not a certified stationary failure.
It does not reproduce the earlier catastrophic blind-critic result or support the simple explanation that local information is necessarily the damaging restriction.
The long matrix does not cross every repair, lambda setting, or exact-label weight-four control.
